# Git LFS is currently disabled on GitHub for this repo, so binaries are stored normally for now.
# To switch back to LFS later: change "binary" to "filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text"
# and run "git lfs migrate import" (see project notes).
#
# "binary" = no line-ending conversion, no text diff or merge: protects these files from corruption.
*.blend binary
*.fbx   binary
*.glb   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.psd   binary
*.tga   binary
*.exr   binary
*.hdr   binary
*.wav   binary